    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=SVb8yS9ewkeZpP2R]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=SVb8yS9ewkeZpP2R]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=SVb8yS9ewkeZpP2R]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]. <em>Failure:</em> Half damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.</p>",
